# Build outputs
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
# Exception: works/ship/build/ holds CI build scripts (source, not output).
# The broad build/ rule above must not swallow them, or the
# Build Standalone Executables workflow fails with MODULE_NOT_FOUND.
# 方案 P 把顶层 packaging/ 物理化迁到 works/ship/ 后，例外若还写 packaging/build/
# 就等于没有例外——脚本继续被 build/ 吞掉，干净检出里整个目录不存在。
!works/ship/build/
!works/ship/build/*.js
!works/ship/build/*.json
!works/ship/build/shims/
!works/ship/build/shims/*.mjs
*.iso
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
# sqlite WAL-mode sidecars are runtime artifacts recreated on every open;
# tracking them made the worktree permanently dirty (same class as *.db-wal above).
*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal

# Flutter build caches (regenerable: flutter build / flutter pub get)
apps/khy-os-client-app/build/
apps/khy-os-client-app/.dart_tool/

