#   （曾误吞 runtime/node/backend/src/services/{publish,domain/deploy/publish}，见 buildRootGuard SOURCE_DIR_ALLOWLIST）。
/publish/
_dbg_*
_repl_*
_smoke_*

# Vendored tooling & reference material
# tools/deepseek-eyes: originally an accidental phantom git link (mode 160000,
# with no .gitmodules mapping). A nested repo can't be checked out on clone,
# and its local HEAD drifting made `git status` permanently dirty — which in
# turn kept the dual-machine autopull `--clean-only` gate from ever firing
# (the direct cause of the task loop never closing).
# The phantom link is removed from the index (`git rm --cached
# tools/deepseek-eyes` on 2026-08-27) and the whole directory is now a
# machine-local vendored checkout that stays entirely out of git, so the
# worktree can converge to clean and the sync loop can close.
tools/deepseek-eyes/
docs/_ref/

